[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Pi-hole answers DNS on port 53, so nothing else may listen there (for
instance local_unbound). Start it and build its blocklist with:

  sysrc pihole_ftl_enable=YES
  service pihole_ftl start
  pihole -g

Set the password of the web interface (http://<address>/admin/) with
`pihole setpassword`. A new installation asks Quad9 (9.9.9.9,
149.112.112.112); choose other upstream servers in the web interface or
with `pihole-FTL --config dns.upstreams '["1.1.1.1"]'`. Configuration and databases are in
%%PREFIX%%/etc/pihole, logs in /var/log/pihole.
EOM
}
]
